"交州太守士燮之弟，因董卓之乱从朝廷逃回交州，任合浦太守。士燮降于孙权后成为孙权手下部将，因侄子一行人叛乱而遭牵连，沦为庶人。后因犯法遭斩首。","tc":"交州太守士燮之弟，因董卓之亂從朝廷逃回交州，任合浦太守。士燮降于孫權后成為孫權手下部將，因侄子一行人叛亂而遭牽連，淪為庶人。后因犯法遭斬首。","en":"Younger brother of Shi Xie, Governor of Jiao Province. He fled from the imperial court back to Jiao Province due to the turmoil caused by Dong Zhuo and served as Governor of Hepu. After Shi Xie submitted to Sun Quan, he became one of Sun Quan's subordinate officers. He was implicated when his nephew's faction staged a rebellion and was stripped of his titles, reduced to commoner status. He was later executed for a criminal offense.","jp":"交州太守・士燮の弟。董卓の乱によって朝廷から交州へと逃げ帰り、合浦太守に任じられた。士燮が孫権に降伏した後はその配下の部将となったが、甥たちによる反乱に連座して庶人に落とされた。後に法を犯して斬首された。","kr":"교주태수 사섭의 아우로, 동탁의 난을 피해 조정에서 교주로 피신하여 합포태수를 지냈다. 사섭이 손권에게 항복한 후 손권 휘하의 부장이 되었으나, 조카 일행의 반란에 연루되어 서인으로 강등되었다. 이후 법을 범하여 참수당했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10331","remark":"","surname":"士","surnameTc":"士","surnameEn":"Shi","surnameJp":"士","surnameKr":"사","surnameOther":"","name":"壹","nameTc":"壹","nameEn":"Yi","nameJp":"壱","nameKr":"일","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"士壹","power":"WJ10169","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1059","gender":"0","rule":"48","force":"36","wise":"67","politics":"74","charm":"55","will":"59","ruleTalent":"4","forceTalent":"2","wiseTalent":"7","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"5","willTalent":"5","weaponMaster":"10/10/10/10/10/64/25/10","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"2300","battleSoulPoint":"1200","debateSoulPoint":"4400","strategy":"","strategy2":"1005001","professions":"1/0/0/0/0/0/0/3/3/3/0/1/0/0/0/1/1/2/1/3/1/0/